<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS3" title="In Appendix B Experimental Details and Additional Results ‣ ID-LoRA: Efficient Low-Rank Adaptation Inspired by Matrix Interpolative Decomposition" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.3 </span>Ablation: Impact of Pretrained Parameter Cluster Number k</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
