<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Theoretical Framework of ID-LoRA</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To preserve theoretical completeness, we first restate the three assumptions from the paper, then, derive Theorems 1 and 2 via the detailed definitions that follow, providing full proofs in this section.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Problem Setup and Assumptions</h3>

<div id="Thmassumption3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_assumption">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmassumption3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Assumption 3</span></span><span id="Thmassumption3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Task Clustering Structure)</span></h6>
<div id="Thmassumption3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmassumption3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmassumption3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let <math id="Thmassumption3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{W^{*}_{i}\}_{i=1}^{m}\subset\mathbb{R}^{d_{1}\times d_{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msubsup><mo>⊂</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{W^{*}_{i}\}_{i=1}^{m}\subset\mathbb{R}^{d_{1}\times d_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math> denote the optimal parameter matrices for <math id="Thmassumption3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math> related tasks. We assume these matrices can be partitioned into <math id="Thmassumption3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> disjoint clusters <math id="Thmassumption3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{1},\mathcal{C}_{2}\ldots,\mathcal{C}_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{1},\mathcal{C}_{2}\ldots,\mathcal{C}_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> (with <math id="Thmassumption3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k&lt;m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k&lt;m</annotation></semantics></math>)
such that:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\forall i,j\in\mathcal{C}_{l},\quad\text{Rank}(W^{*}_{i}-W^{*}_{j})\leq r_{l}&lt;\min(d_{1},d_{2})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">Rank</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\forall i,j\in\mathcal{C}_{l},\quad\text{Rank}(W^{*}_{i}-W^{*}_{j})\leq r_{l}&lt;\min(d_{1},d_{2})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmassumption3.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmassumption3.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmassumption3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math> denotes the <math id="Thmassumption3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>l</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l</annotation></semantics></math>-th cluster, and <math id="Thmassumption3.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{l}</annotation></semantics></math> is the intrinsic rank difference within the cluster.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmassumption4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_assumption">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmassumption4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Assumption 4</span></span><span id="Thmassumption4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Task Parameter Sharing)</span></h6>
<div id="Thmassumption4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmassumption4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmassumption4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">We assume the existence of a shared feature matrix <math id="Thmassumption4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{2}\times r_{g}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{2}\times r_{g}}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="Thmassumption4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{g}&lt;d_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{g}&lt;d_{2}</annotation></semantics></math>, such that every optimal task-specific parameter matrix can be written as:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W^{*}_{i}=BA_{i}+E_{i},\quad\|E_{i}\|_{F}^{2}\leq\epsilon" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W^{*}_{i}=BA_{i}+E_{i},\quad\|E_{i}\|_{F}^{2}\leq\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmassumption4.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmassumption4.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmassumption4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{r_{g}\times d_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{i}\in\mathbb{R}^{r_{g}\times d_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math> is a task-specific matrix and <math id="Thmassumption4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is the reconstruction error.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmdefinition2" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmdefinition2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 2</span></span><span id="Thmdefinition2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Pivot Sensitivity)</span></h6>
<div id="Thmdefinition2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmdefinition2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefinition2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The </span>CUR<span id="Thmdefinition2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> decomposition’s approximation accuracy crucially depends on pivot selection, with reconstruction errors escalating sharply when the pivots inadequately capture the principal row or column subspaces,</span></p>
<table id="A1.E13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\max_{\text{bad pivots}}\|W-\tilde{W}_{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}^{2}&gt;\min_{\text{good pivots}}\|W-\tilde{W}_{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}^{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">bad pivots</mtext></munder><mo>⁡</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mtext>CUR</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><munder><mi>min</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">good pivots</mtext></munder><mo>⁡</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mtext>CUR</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\max_{\text{bad pivots}}\|W-\tilde{W}_{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}^{2}&gt;\min_{\text{good pivots}}\|W-\tilde{W}_{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Core Definitions</h3>

<div id="Thmdefinition3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmdefinition3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 3</span></span><span id="Thmdefinition3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Task Parameter Distance)</span></h6>
<div id="Thmdefinition3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmdefinition3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefinition3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For any pair of tasks <math id="Thmdefinition3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i,j\in[m]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i,j\in[m]</annotation></semantics></math>, their distance is defined as the squared Frobenius norm of the difference between their optimal parameter matrices:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d(i,j)=\|W^{*}_{i}-W^{*}_{j}\|_{F}^{2}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d(i,j)=\|W^{*}_{i}-W^{*}_{j}\|_{F}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmdefinition4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmdefinition4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 4</span></span><span id="Thmdefinition4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Cluster Low-Rank Decomposition)</span></h6>
<div id="Thmdefinition4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmdefinition4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefinition4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Let the optimal parameter matrices of the <math id="Thmdefinition4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math> tasks be <math id="Thmdefinition4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{W^{*}_{i}\}_{i=1}^{m}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{1}\times d_{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msubsup><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{W^{*}_{i}\}_{i=1}^{m}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{1}\times d_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
<ol id="A1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A1.I1.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.ix1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(1)</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.ix1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Perform </span><math id="A1.I1.ix1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.ix1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">-means on </span><math id="A1.I1.ix1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{W^{*}_{i}\}_{i=1}^{m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{W^{*}_{i}\}_{i=1}^{m}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.ix1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> to obtain disjoint clusters </span><math id="A1.I1.ix1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\mathcal{C}_{l}\}_{l=1}^{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathcal{C}_{l}\}_{l=1}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.ix1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.ix2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.ix2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(2)</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.ix2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.ix2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.ix2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">For each cluster </span><math id="A1.I1.ix2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.ix2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">, compute the centroid matrix
</span><math id="A1.I1.ix2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M_{l}=\frac{1}{|\mathcal{C}_{l}|}\sum_{i\in\mathcal{C}_{l}}W^{*}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M_{l}=\frac{1}{|\mathcal{C}_{l}|}\sum_{i\in\mathcal{C}_{l}}W^{*}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.ix2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> and extract its rank </span><math id="A1.I1.ix2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{l}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.ix2.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> truncated SVD, yielding the cluster-specific matrix </span><math id="A1.I1.ix2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{l}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{1}\times r_{l}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{l}\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{1}\times r_{l}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.ix2.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.ix3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A1.I1.ix3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">(3)</span></span> 
<div id="A1.I1.ix3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.ix3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.ix3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Learn the shared matrix </span><math id="A1.I1.ix3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{2}\times r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B\in\mathbb{R}^{d_{2}\times r}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.ix3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> by solving</span></p>
<table id="A1.E15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\min_{B}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\|W^{*}_{i}-BA_{l(i)}\|_{F}^{2}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mmultiscripts><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mprescripts></mprescripts><mi>B</mi><mrow></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo lspace="0em">⁡</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\min_{B}\sum_{i=1}^{m}\|W^{*}_{i}-BA_{l(i)}\|_{F}^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(15)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.I1.ix3.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.I1.ix3.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where </span><math id="A1.I1.ix3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="l(i)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">l(i)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.ix3.p1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> denotes the cluster of task </span><math id="A1.I1.ix3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.I1.ix3.p1.2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">.</span></p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmdefinition5" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmdefinition5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 5</span></span><span id="Thmdefinition5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Multi-Task Reconstruction)</span></h6>
<div id="Thmdefinition5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmdefinition5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefinition5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The parameter matrix for task <math id="Thmdefinition5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> is reconstructed as</span></p>
<table id="A1.E16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{W}_{i}=BA_{l(i)}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{W}_{i}=BA_{l(i)}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(16)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Thmdefinition6" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_definition">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmdefinition6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 6</span></span><span id="Thmdefinition6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (CUR Decomposition)</span></h6>
<div id="Thmdefinition6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmdefinition6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefinition6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Given a matrix <math id="Thmdefinition6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times d}</annotation></semantics></math>, a </span>CUR<span id="Thmdefinition6.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> decomposition approximates <math id="Thmdefinition6.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math> as a product of three matrices:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W\approx CUR" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>U</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W\approx CUR</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(17)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmdefinition6.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmdefinition6.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmdefinition6.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C\in\mathbb{R}^{d\times c}</annotation></semantics></math>, and is a subset of <math id="Thmdefinition6.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math> columns from <math id="Thmdefinition6.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math>. <math id="Thmdefinition6.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R\in\mathbb{R}^{r\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R\in\mathbb{R}^{r\times n}</annotation></semantics></math> and is a subset of <math id="Thmdefinition6.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math> rows from <math id="Thmdefinition6.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math>.
<math id="Thmdefinition6.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U\in\mathbb{R}^{c\times r}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U\in\mathbb{R}^{c\times r}</annotation></semantics></math>, which is a weight matrix constructed to minimize the approximation error <math id="Thmdefinition6.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|A-CUR\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>U</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|A-CUR\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Main Theorems</h3>

<div id="Thmtheorem3" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_theorem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmtheorem3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem 3</span></span><span id="Thmtheorem3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Clustering Reconstruction)</span></h6>
<div id="Thmtheorem3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmtheorem3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under Assumptions 1 and 2, the clustering-aware decomposition achieves a tighter reconstruction error bound compared to global low rank decomposition:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E18" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{i=1}^{m}\|W^{*}_{i}-\tilde{W}_{i}\|_{F}^{2}\leq\sum_{i=1}^{m}\|W^{*}_{i}-\tilde{W}^{\text{global}}_{i}\|_{F}^{2}-\Delta" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msubsup><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false" rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">global</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{i=1}^{m}\|W^{*}_{i}-\tilde{W}_{i}\|_{F}^{2}\leq\sum_{i=1}^{m}\|W^{*}_{i}-\tilde{W}^{\text{global}}_{i}\|_{F}^{2}-\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(18)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmtheorem3.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem3.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmtheorem3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta=\sum_{l=1}^{k}\sum_{i\in\mathcal{C}_{l}}\|B(A_{l(i)}-A^{\text{global}})\|_{F}^{2}\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mrow><msub><mo rspace="0em">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></msub><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">global</mtext></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta=\sum_{l=1}^{k}\sum_{i\in\mathcal{C}_{l}}\|B(A_{l(i)}-A^{\text{global}})\|_{F}^{2}\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>. The inequality becomes strict (<math id="Thmtheorem3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>) when tasks exhibit clustering structure.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof.</span>  Let <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{W}_{i}^{\text{global}}=BA^{\text{global}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mtext>global</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mtext>global</mtext></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{W}_{i}^{\text{global}}=BA^{\text{global}}</annotation></semantics></math> denote the reconstruction obtained from the globally shared low-rank factorization.
By <span id="A1.SS3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Assumption 2</span>, we have</p>
<table id="A1.E19" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E19.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\bigl\lVert W^{*}_{i}-\tilde{W}_{i}^{\text{global}}\bigr\rVert_{F}^{2}=\bigl\lVert B(A_{i}-A^{\text{global}})+E_{i}\bigr\rVert_{F}^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mtext>global</mtext></msubsup><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">∥</mo><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0.0835em" rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mtext>global</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">∥</mo><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0.0835em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bigl\lVert W^{*}_{i}-\tilde{W}_{i}^{\text{global}}\bigr\rVert_{F}^{2}=\bigl\lVert B(A_{i}-A^{\text{global}})+E_{i}\bigr\rVert_{F}^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(19)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">In addition, the cluster-aware reconstruction (i.e., <span id="A1.SS3.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Definition 2</span>) satisfies</p>
<table id="A1.E20" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E20.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\bigl\lVert W^{*}_{i}-\tilde{W}_{i}\bigr\rVert_{F}^{2}=\bigl\lVert B(A_{i}-A_{l(i)})+E_{i}\bigr\rVert_{F}^{2}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">∥</mo><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0.0835em" rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.0835em">∥</mo><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0.0835em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bigl\lVert W^{*}_{i}-\tilde{W}_{i}\bigr\rVert_{F}^{2}=\bigl\lVert B(A_{i}-A_{l(i)})+E_{i}\bigr\rVert_{F}^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{l(i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{l(i)}</annotation></semantics></math> is the cluster centroid, we have</p>
<table id="A1.E21" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lVert A_{i}-A_{l(i)}\rVert_{F}^{2}\leq\lVert A_{i}-A^{\text{global}}\rVert_{F}^{2}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo fence="true" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo rspace="0.1389em">≤</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">∥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mtext>global</mtext></msup></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∥</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lVert A_{i}-A_{l(i)}\rVert_{F}^{2}\leq\lVert A_{i}-A^{\text{global}}\rVert_{F}^{2},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p3.2" class="ltx_p">and <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> is optimized to minimize the within-cluster approximation error.
Consequently, <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\geq 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\geq 0</annotation></semantics></math>.
Whenever the inter-cluster task discrepancy is significant, <math id="A1.SS3.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, demonstrating the superiority of the cluster-aware decomposition.</p>
</div>
<div id="Thmtheorem4" class="ltx_theorem ltx_theorem_theorem">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_title_theorem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_theorem"><span id="Thmtheorem4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Theorem 4</span></span><span id="Thmtheorem4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> (Cluster-Pivot Stability)</span></h6>
<div id="Thmtheorem4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Thmtheorem4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Under Definition 1, the clustering-based local pivot selection ensures a tighter expected error bound compared to global pivot selection:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E22" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{P}}\left[\max_{1\leq i\leq m}\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}^{2}\right]\geq\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}\left[\max_{1\leq i\leq m}\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}\|_{F}^{2}\right]," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mtext>CUR</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></munder><mo>⁡</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{P}}\left[\max_{1\leq i\leq m}\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}^{2}\right]\geq\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}\left[\max_{1\leq i\leq m}\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}\|_{F}^{2}\right],</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(22)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Thmtheorem4.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="Thmtheorem4.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">where <math id="Thmtheorem4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mtext>CUR</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}</annotation></semantics></math> is the reconstruction parameter using global pivots on all tasks, <math id="Thmtheorem4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{W}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{W}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is the reconstruction parameter using cluster-local pivots (per-cluster </span>CUR<span id="Thmtheorem4.p1.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic"> on <math id="Thmtheorem4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math>), and <math id="Thmtheorem4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math> is the set of pivots selected from cluster <math id="Thmtheorem4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math>’s centroid matrix.</span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS3.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof.</span> Step 1: Error Decomposition and Notation.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">(1) <span id="A1.SS3.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Global Approximation Error</span>: For task <math id="A1.SS3.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>, the global CUR approximation is:</p>
<table id="A1.E23" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}=C_{\mathcal{P}}U_{\mathcal{P}}R_{\mathcal{P}},\quad\mathcal{P}\subseteq[d_{1}]\times[d_{2}],|\mathcal{P}|=s" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mtext>CUR</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo>⊆</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}=C_{\mathcal{P}}U_{\mathcal{P}}R_{\mathcal{P}},\quad\mathcal{P}\subseteq[d_{1}]\times[d_{2}],|\mathcal{P}|=s</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(23)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p5.2" class="ltx_p">where pivot set <math id="A1.SS3.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}</annotation></semantics></math> is uniformly sampled from all rows or columns.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p6.1" class="ltx_p">(2) <span id="A1.SS3.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Local Approximation Error</span>: For task <math id="A1.SS3.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> in cluster <math id="A1.SS3.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A1.E24" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{W}_{i}=C_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}U_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}R_{\mathcal{P}_{l}},\mathcal{P}_{l}\sim\text{cluster-specific distribution}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mtext>cluster-specific distribution</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{W}_{i}=C_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}U_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}R_{\mathcal{P}_{l}},\mathcal{P}_{l}\sim\text{cluster-specific distribution}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(24)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p6.2" class="ltx_p">with pivots <math id="A1.SS3.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math> selected from cluster-specific rows or columns.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p7.1" class="ltx_p">Step 2: Lower Bound for Global Error.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p8.1" class="ltx_p">By Definition 1, there exists at least one cluster <math id="A1.SS3.p8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{l^{*}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{l^{*}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p9.1" class="ltx_p">(1) Rare Feature Non-Ignorability:</p>
<table id="A1.E25" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E25.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}_{\mathcal{P}}(\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}\notin\text{span}(C_{\mathcal{P}}))\geq\eta_{l^{*}}&gt;0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo>∉</mo><mrow><mtext>span</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}_{\mathcal{P}}(\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}\notin\text{span}(C_{\mathcal{P}}))\geq\eta_{l^{*}}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(25)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p9.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}</annotation></semantics></math> is the unique feature direction of <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}\|_{2}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}\|_{2}=1</annotation></semantics></math>. Since it has negligible weight in the global feature space (e.g., <math id="A1.SS3.p9.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma_{l^{*}}&lt;\sum\sigma_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo rspace="0.111em">&lt;</mo><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma_{l^{*}}&lt;\sum\sigma_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>).</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p10" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p10.1" class="ltx_p">(2) Error Lower Bound:
when <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}</annotation></semantics></math> is missed:</p>
<table id="A1.E26" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E26.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}\geq\gamma_{l^{*}}\quad\forall i\in\mathcal{C}_{l^{*}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mtext>CUR</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub></mrow><mspace style="width:1.167em;" width="1.167em"></mspace><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}\geq\gamma_{l^{*}}\quad\forall i\in\mathcal{C}_{l^{*}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(26)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p10.2" class="ltx_p">Thus:</p>
<table id="A1.E27" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{P}}\left[\max_{i}\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}\right]\geq\gamma_{l^{*}}\cdot\eta_{l^{*}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>[</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mi>i</mi></munder><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi><mtext>CUR</mtext></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}_{\mathcal{P}}\left[\max_{i}\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}\right]\geq\gamma_{l^{*}}\cdot\eta_{l^{*}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(27)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p10.3" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\gamma_{l^{*}}=\sup_{\mathcal{P}:\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}\notin\text{span}(C_{\mathcal{P}})}\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em">=</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">sup</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo>∉</mo><mrow><mtext>span</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∥</mo><mi>W</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mtext>CUR</mtext></msup><mo lspace="0em">∥</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{l^{*}}=\sup_{\mathcal{P}:\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}\notin\text{span}(C_{\mathcal{P}})}\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}^{\textup{CUR}}\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math> (minimum error when <math id="A1.SS3.p10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}_{l^{*}}</annotation></semantics></math> is missed globally).</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p11" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p11.1" class="ltx_p">Step 3: Upper Bound for Local Error.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p12" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p12.1" class="ltx_p">For any cluster <math id="A1.SS3.p12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math>, local pivot selection satisfies:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p13" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p13.1" class="ltx_p">(1) Feature Coverage Property:</p>
<table id="A1.E28" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E28.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{P}_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}(\mathbf{v}_{l}\in\text{span}(C_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}))\geq 1-\epsilon_{l}\quad(\epsilon_{l}\leq e^{-c|\mathcal{P}_{l}|})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>ℙ</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mtext>span</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{P}_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}(\mathbf{v}_{l}\in\text{span}(C_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}))\geq 1-\epsilon_{l}\quad(\epsilon_{l}\leq e^{-c|\mathcal{P}_{l}|})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(28)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p13.2" class="ltx_p">because <math id="A1.SS3.p13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{v}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math> is prominent within <math id="A1.SS3.p13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{C}_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{C}_{l}</annotation></semantics></math> (by Assumption 1).</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p14" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p14.1" class="ltx_p">(2) Error Decomposition:</p>
<table id="A1.E29" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}\|_{F}\leq\underbrace{\|M_{l}-\tilde{M}_{l}\|_{F}}_{\text{cluster center error}}+\underbrace{\|W_{i}^{*}-M_{l}\|_{F}}_{\leq\delta_{l}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>W</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><munder><munder accentunder="true"><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>cluster center error</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|W_{i}^{*}-\tilde{W}_{i}\|_{F}\leq\underbrace{\|M_{l}-\tilde{M}_{l}\|_{F}}_{\text{cluster center error}}+\underbrace{\|W_{i}^{*}-M_{l}\|_{F}}_{\leq\delta_{l}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(29)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p14.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS3.p14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{M}_{l}=C_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}U_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}R_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>U</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{M}_{l}=C_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}U_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}R_{\mathcal{P}_{l}}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p15" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p15.1" class="ltx_p">(3) Low-Rank Approximation:
By Assumption 1 (<math id="A1.SS3.p15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{rank}(M_{l})\leq r_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>rank</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{rank}(M_{l})\leq r_{l}</annotation></semantics></math>) and CUR theory:</p>
<table id="A1.E30" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\|M_{l}-\tilde{M}_{l}\|_{F}\leq(1+\sqrt{r_{l}})\|M_{l}-M_{l}^{(r_{l})}\|_{F}=0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>M</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></msqrt></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>M</mi><mi>l</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\|M_{l}-\tilde{M}_{l}\|_{F}\leq(1+\sqrt{r_{l}})\|M_{l}-M_{l}^{(r_{l})}\|_{F}=0</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(30)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p15.2" class="ltx_p">when <math id="A1.SS3.p15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{v}_{l}\in\text{span}(C_{\mathcal{P}_{l}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐯</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mtext>span</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{v}_{l}\in\text{span}(C_{\mathcal{P}_{l}})</annotation></semantics></math>. Hence:</p>
<table id="A1.E31" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}_{l}^{\text{local}}\leq\delta_{l}\quad\text{with probability}\geq 1-\epsilon_{l}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mspace style="width:1em;" width="1em"></mspace><mrow><mtext>with probability</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}_{l}^{\text{local}}\leq\delta_{l}\quad\text{with probability}\geq 1-\epsilon_{l}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(31)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p15.3" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS3.p15.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{l}=\max_{i\in\mathcal{C}_{l}}\|W_{i}^{*}-M_{l}\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{l}=\max_{i\in\mathcal{C}_{l}}\|W_{i}^{*}-M_{l}\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math> (intra-cluster consistency measure).</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p16" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p16.1" class="ltx_p">(4) Expectation Control:</p>
<table id="A1.E32" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[\mathcal{E}_{l}^{\text{local}}]\leq\delta_{l}(1-\epsilon_{l})+(\text{diam}(\mathcal{C}_{l})+\|M_{l}\|_{F})\epsilon_{l}\leq\delta_{l}+\mathcal{O}(\epsilon_{l})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mi>l</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext>diam</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[\mathcal{E}_{l}^{\text{local}}]\leq\delta_{l}(1-\epsilon_{l})+(\text{diam}(\mathcal{C}_{l})+\|M_{l}\|_{F})\epsilon_{l}\leq\delta_{l}+\mathcal{O}(\epsilon_{l})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(32)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS3.p16.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS3.p16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{diam}(\mathcal{C}_{l})=\max_{i,j\in\mathcal{C}_{l}}\|W_{i}^{*}-W_{j}^{*}\|_{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>diam</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>max</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒞</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>W</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{diam}(\mathcal{C}_{l})=\max_{i,j\in\mathcal{C}_{l}}\|W_{i}^{*}-W_{j}^{*}\|_{F}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p17" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p17.1" class="ltx_p">Step 4: Global vs. Local Error Comparison:</p>
<table id="A1.E33" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{E}[\mathcal{E}_{\text{global}}]\geq\gamma_{l^{*}}\eta_{l^{*}},\quad\mathbb{E}[\mathcal{E}_{\text{local}}]\leq\max_{l}(\delta_{l}+\mathcal{O}(\epsilon_{l}))" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>global</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>𝔼</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mrow><munder><mi>max</mi><mi>l</mi></munder><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{E}[\mathcal{E}_{\text{global}}]\geq\gamma_{l^{*}}\eta_{l^{*}},\quad\mathbb{E}[\mathcal{E}_{\text{local}}]\leq\max_{l}(\delta_{l}+\mathcal{O}(\epsilon_{l}))</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(33)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS3.p18" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p18.1" class="ltx_p">From Definition 1 (<math id="A1.SS3.p18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{l^{*}}\eta_{l^{*}}&gt;\delta_{l}+\epsilon_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub></mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{l^{*}}\eta_{l^{*}}&gt;\delta_{l}+\epsilon_{l}</annotation></semantics></math>), the theorem follows.
First, global error lower bound depends on rare feature miss probability <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{l^{*}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>η</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{l^{*}}</annotation></semantics></math> and minimum miss error <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma_{l^{*}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>γ</mi><msup><mi>l</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma_{l^{*}}</annotation></semantics></math>. Then, local error upper bound is controlled by intra-cluster consistency <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta_{l}</annotation></semantics></math> and feature coverage failure <math id="A1.SS3.p18.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon_{l}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon_{l}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T4" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A1.T4.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:336.6pt;height:87.6pt;vertical-align:-41.8pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-42.1pt,11.0pt) scale(0.8,0.8) ;">
